OL,3,GNEWSA'Acceptance ran through Dolly
OL,4,AParton's lyrics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who spent five years studying
OL,7,FDolly Parton's lyrics for his PhD says
OL,8,Facceptance ran through her music.
OL,10,FJames Barker, 34, wrote his thesis at
OL,11,FNewcastle University exploring LGBTQ+
OL,12,Finclusion in the country music
OL,13,Findustry, and said Parton created a
OL,14,F"space where a lot of LGBTQIA+
OL,15,Flisteners can hear themselves".
OL,17,FTributes have been pouring in for the
OL,18,Fcountry music icon who died on Tuesday
OL,19,Faged 80, including from former BBC
OL,20,FRadio Tees presenter Stan Laundon who
OL,21,Fsaid she was a "bundle of fun".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
