OL,3,GNEWSA'Acceptance ran through Dolly
OL,4,AParton's lyrics'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCumbrian superfan Joe Skelly, who ran
OL,7,Fher official UK fan club for many
OL,8,Fyears, said she was "very, very
OL,9,Fremarkable" and planned to create a
OL,10,Fmusic room in his house for his
OL,11,Fhundreds of pieces of memorabilia.
